{"content":[{"c":["JEHOZABAD"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Shomer’s son, who was a servant of King Joash and later, with another assailant, murdered the king at Millo (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.12.21","r":"2Kgs.12.21","rawR":"2Kgs.12.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.12.21","value":"2Kgs.12.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 12:21"},"). In a parallel passage, Jehozabad is called the son of Shimrith the Moabitess (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.24.26","r":"2Chr.24.26","rawR":"2Chr.24.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.24.26","value":"2Chr.24.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 24:26"},"). King Amaziah, Joash’s son, eventually executed Jehozabad for the murder (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.25.3","r":"2Chr.25.3","rawR":"2Chr.25.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.25.3","value":"2Chr.25.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"25:3"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Obed-edom’s second son and a member of a Levitical Korahite family appointed by King David to be gatekeepers in the temple (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.26.4","r":"1Chr.26.4","rawR":"1Chr.26.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.26.4","value":"1Chr.26.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 26:4"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Benjamite military commander who served under King Jehoshaphat of Judah and commanded 180,000 men in his army (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.17.18","r":"2Chr.17.18","rawR":"2Chr.17.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.17.18","value":"2Chr.17.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 17:18"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Jehozabad","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 12:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.12.21","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.12.21","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.12.21"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 24:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.24.26","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.24.26","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.24.26"},{"anchorText":"25:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.25.3","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.25.3","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.25.3"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 26:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.26.4","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.26.4","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.26.4"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 17:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.17.18","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.17.18","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.17.18"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"8a9bf282dbcb172cffd00445e94d81eb2618027ac26b6e4546de40351f0fceab","sourceItemName":"Jehozabad","sourceItemOrder":161,"sourceMember":"Articles/J.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Jehozabad","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Jehozabad","title":"Jehozabad","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}